    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Using Nowhere to Run on a small Sazh's Chocobo (currently ~1/2) while already having board dominance with three creatures including two flyers. The opponent likely has bigger threats in their deck (Mossborn Hydra, Mightform Harmonizer, Icetill Explorer) that would be much better Nowhere to Run targets. The Chocobo isn't an immediate threat given Haiku Libby's dominant board position.",
