      "description": "Attacking with the Otter Token (1/1 prowess) into a board with multiple potential blockers (Llanowar Elves, Sazh's Chocobo, Mossborn Hydra) risks losing a prowess creature that has growing value with Stormchaser's Talent and spells in hand (Boomerang Basics, No More Lies). The opponent can block and kill it for free with any creature 1/1 or larger.",
